{"nodes": [{"id": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc_query", "label": "Memory: What test_mamba3_olmo3_370M_is_parameter_matched Compares Against", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-07-25T21:48:42.503537+00:00", "author": null, "contributor": "graphify", "rationale": "Follow-up query memo traced from the parameter-match test; outcome signalled useful."}, {"id": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matched", "label": "test_mamba3_olmo3_370M_is_parameter_matched", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc.md", "source_location": "model_test.py:133-139", "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-07-25T21:48:42.503537+00:00", "author": null, "contributor": "graphify", "rationale": "Compares config.num_active_non_embedding_params against the same metric on TransformerConfig.olmo3_370M, NOT total params: the reference is 371.26M active-non-embedding vs 474.0M total because both configs leave the LM head untied."}, {"id": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc_transformerconfig_olmo3_370m", "label": "TransformerConfig.olmo3_370M Reference Config", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-07-25T21:48:42.503537+00:00", "author": null, "contributor": "graphify", "rationale": "The dense-transformer baseline the Mamba preset is matched against: 371.26M active non-embedding params, 474.0M total, LM head untied."}, {"id": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc_num_active_non_embedding_params", "label": "config.num_active_non_embedding_params", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-07-25T21:48:42.503537+00:00", "author": null, "contributor": "graphify", "rationale": "Chosen as the matching metric instead of total params so that the untied LM head and embeddings do not dominate the comparison between a hybrid Mamba stack and a dense transformer."}, {"id": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc_mamba3_olmo3_370m", "label": "mamba3_olmo3_370M Preset", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-07-25T21:48:42.503537+00:00", "author": null, "contributor": "graphify", "rationale": "Measured at 362.99M active non-embedding params with d_state=128, i.e. 2.23 percent below the reference - matching the 2.2 percent the docstring claims. Because it sits BELOW the reference, widening d_state closes the gap rather than opening it."}, {"id": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc_mamba3_hybrid_like", "label": "mamba3_hybrid_like()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-07-25T21:48:42.503537+00:00", "author": null, "contributor": "graphify", "rationale": "The shared preset builder traversed while tracing where the parameter-matched preset's d_state, n_groups and mimo_rank values originate."}, {"id": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc_mimo_rank", "label": "mimo_rank", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-07-25T21:48:42.503537+00:00", "author": null, "contributor": "graphify", "rationale": "The entire parameter gap traces to mimo_rank=1: going from rank 4 to 1 removes 787k params per layer across 12 layers, i.e. 9.45M."}, {"id": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc_n_groups", "label": "n_groups", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-07-25T21:48:42.503537+00:00", "author": null, "contributor": "graphify", "rationale": "The rejected alternative knob: n_groups=4 at d_state=128 lands at 374.79M, only 0.95 percent off, but it was documented as rejected rather than adopted."}, {"id": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc_bc_out", "label": "bc_out = n_groups * mimo_rank * d_state", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-07-25T21:48:42.503537+00:00", "author": null, "contributor": "graphify", "rationale": "The three-factor width product that makes n_groups, mimo_rank and d_state interchangeable levers on the parameter budget - which is why the mimo_rank=1 deficit can be repaid by widening d_state."}, {"id": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc_d_state_192", "label": "d_state=192 Dominates d_state=128", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-07-25T21:48:42.503537+00:00", "author": null, "contributor": "graphify", "rationale": "Key result: d_state=192 gives 364.96M = 1.70 percent off, strictly better than 128's 2.23 percent, AND admits b in {2,3,4,6} instead of only {2,4}. It therefore dominates 128 on both parameter match and block-size expressiveness, while 96 is worse on params at 2.49 percent."}, {"id": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc_three_percent_tolerance", "label": "3 Percent Parameter-Match Tolerance", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-07-25T21:48:42.503537+00:00", "author": null, "contributor": "graphify", "rationale": "The 3 percent band is deliberate, not incidental: it is wide enough to admit the mimo_rank=1 deficit (2.23 percent) without forcing a compensating architectural change."}, {"id": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc__padded", "label": "_padded() Official-Kernel Lane Padding", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-07-25T21:48:42.503537+00:00", "author": null, "contributor": "graphify", "rationale": "_padded(192)=256, so a b=3 arm wastes 25 percent of QK lanes on zeros. The cost is numerically neutral and confined to the official path, so it was judged acceptable."}, {"id": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc_power_of_two_block_size_3_mismatch", "label": "No Power of Two Is Divisible by 3", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-07-25T21:48:42.503537+00:00", "author": null, "contributor": "graphify", "rationale": "The irreducible trade-off, verified rather than assumed: any hardware-friendly power-of-two d_state is incompatible with b=3, so a b=3 arm must either pay kernel padding or abandon power-of-two widths."}, {"id": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc_rotation_preprocessing_overhead", "label": "Rotation Preprocessing Dominates b>=3 Mixer Time", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-07-25T21:48:42.503537+00:00", "author": null, "contributor": "graphify", "rationale": "Rotation preprocessing is roughly 70 percent of mixer time at b>=3, which makes the 25 percent padded-lane waste partly moot as an optimization target."}], "edges": [{"source": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc_query", "target": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matched", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc_query", "target": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc_mamba3_olmo3_370m", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214842_what_does_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matc.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "graphify_out_memory